  "content": "\n\n<p>目前新增 3 種新生物</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>獵人：獵人陣營的成員，他們對怪物和玩家抱有極強的敵意。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discord.com/channels/@me/976894798361419796/1467742045731815537\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1467742044972781652/Screenshot_2026-02-01_234017.png?ex=69817ccc&is=69802b4c&hm=2a9a4ad8e064380171575231445ae013e9a011a58beccc75e4ab817db43bee5d&\" alt=\"\" width=\"735\" height=\"409\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discord.com/channels/@me/976894798361419796/1467742045731815537\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>食屍鬼：一種非常狡猾的生物，討厭被人注視。只要別讓鬼火攻擊到你就好。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1467742045471899668/Screenshot_2026-02-01_234030.png?ex=69817ccc&is=69802b4c&hm=21f4e94c645422a0128a8a2ee4a38ce89184553e84ba2690cf82b8603ffc6100&\" alt=\"\" width=\"602\" height=\"347\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>石靈：對於石頭腦袋來說相當聰明，只要它們不主動攻擊你，就會擋下你的所有攻擊。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1467742044255682620/Screenshot_2026-02-01_233956.png?ex=69817ccc&is=69802b4c&hm=f27c663c7ac6acbfaf15ac2104aec6fb1e113392c34f2121ed599b41db02b6cc&\" alt=\"\" width=\"867\" height=\"547\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.0.1</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>沼靈：居住在沼澤中的憤怒魚人。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841290450272276/Screenshot_2026-02-10_122144.png?ex=698cc332&is=698b71b2&hm=1db09ff6ed62ad3e256243076b7c0d86fbb4cf51e284c8d9ae29f5f7fc15f12c&\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"438\"></p>\n<p>焰翼：火焰蝙蝠，如果受到足夠強力的攻擊會被眩暈：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841289137324227/Screenshot_2026-02-10_121949.png?ex=698cc332&is=698b71b2&hm=0fc20cfc51017f156a55fda09c20f076206ee28d8488227710bf435b2464d573&\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<p>它們會掉落焦翼，可用於煉製抗火藥水。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>虛空祭壇：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841287337972009/Screenshot_2026-02-10_121812.png?ex=698cc331&is=698b71b1&hm=6ba8ddd089d64084394653670eed78a9954b04ed681ee02e25edb084777f1948&\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"641\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;一種全新結構，將（右鍵點擊）不死图腾放入中央的虛空泉中，即可獲得虛空之影。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841287815987272/Screenshot_2026-02-10_121821.png?ex=698cc331&is=698b71b1&hm=af452e191f8c4a88203b6a6f9ea0fedb2d0e56adb763cf799ca058db10ad8045&\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"631\"></p>\n<p>使用虛空之影召喚虛空守衛：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841288269103205/Screenshot_2026-02-10_121846.png?ex=698cc332&is=698b71b2&hm=e9078e567b0dd0d70d3a9557c4e0a55bd81f7e111975cb5fe07111c3fc68edff&\" alt=\"\" width=\"899\" height=\"796\"></p>\n<p>虛空守衛能夠傳送到你身邊、召喚致命的煙霧雲，並用法杖攻擊你。</p>\n<p>該首領也具備架势條，受到足夠攻擊後會進入 3 秒的眩暈狀態。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976894798361419796/1470841288739000483/Screenshot_2026-02-10_121902.png?ex=698cc332&is=698b71b2&hm=380f923d7123e5e3f891227934b1997cd7dc88138a3f89cc86ab2049ab1ba553&\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"778\"></p>\n<p>被擊敗後，虛空守衛會掉落其虛空法杖。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
